# Training emphasis

The screen title is Estimated Training Emphasis. The file remains `ConditioningAdaptationsScreen.tsx`.

`heuristic-v0.1` returns six independent 0–100 indexes. They are not energy percentages, fitness, or measured adaptation. All v0.1 results are low confidence. Do not rewrite saved estimates when the algorithm changes.

Missing work duration or RPE yields null scores and `insufficient_data`. Do not invent durations for distance, reps, or calories.

Use the emphasis colors only inside conditioning views. The home timeline keeps `timelineCategories.conditioning.color`.
